// Golden Crow logo as an inline base64 data-URI.
//
// Inlined (not fetched from /public at runtime) so the share-workout-card
// rasterizer (html-to-image) always has the bytes present and decoded — no
// network round-trip, no loading gate, no broken-logo regression. Source is a
// 256x256 downscale of goldencrow_logo_1024_transparent.png (the card renders
// it at 150x150), keeping this string small. To refresh: downscale the 1024px
// master and re-run `base64`.
export const GOLDENCROW_LOGO_DATA_URI =
  "data:image/png;base64,";
